that all they really needed was each other.

1736
01:43:32,956 --> 01:43:36,125
John and Lori were
married in Cambridge

1737
01:43:36,126 --> 01:43:39,620
by a very special
Justice of the Peace.

1738
01:43:40,089 --> 01:43:42,924
By the power vested in me

1739
01:43:42,925 --> 01:43:46,052
by the New York Jets

1740
01:43:46,053 --> 01:43:50,181
and by the united peoples
of the planet Mongo,

1741
01:43:50,182 --> 01:43:54,060
I now pronounce
you man and wife.

1742
01:43:54,061 --> 01:43:56,554
You may kiss the bride, Johnny.

1743
01:44:14,873 --> 01:44:18,075
Hi. Tom Skerritt.

1744
01:44:18,293 --> 01:44:19,994
Tom Skerritt! Wow!

1745
01:44:20,254 --> 01:44:22,588
Thanks so much for coming.

1746
01:44:22,589 --> 01:44:26,000
My daughter better be alive,
you sick son of a bitch.

1747
01:44:26,969 --> 01:44:30,212
I am so fake-happy for her.

1748
01:45:17,811 --> 01:45:21,230
You know, Sam,
there's only one way to end a perfect day.

1749
01:45:21,231 --> 01:45:22,273
What's that?

1750
01:45:22,274 --> 01:45:23,441
Flash jump.

1751
01:45:23,442 --> 01:45:25,151
Right.

1752
01:45:25,152 --> 01:45:28,321
One, two, three!

1753
01:45:28,322 --> 01:45:30,773
Yeah!

1754
01:45:34,244 --> 01:45:38,080
And that's the story
of how one magical wish

1755
01:45:38,081 --> 01:45:42,702
forever changed the lives
of three very special friends.

1756
01:45:42,920 --> 01:45:47,715
Ted and Tami-Lynn continued their
torrid love affair for quite some time.

1757
01:45:47,716 --> 01:45:51,093
One afternoon,
Ted was caught behind the deli counter

1758
01:45:51,094 --> 01:45:54,639
eating potato salad
off of Tami-Lynn's bare bottom.

1759
01:45:54,640 --> 01:45:58,259
He was instantly
promoted to store manager.

1760
01:45:58,435 --> 01:46:00,770
Sam Jones moved
back to Hollywood

1761
01:46:00,771 --> 01:46:03,481
with the goal of
restarting his film career.

1762
01:46:03,482 --> 01:46:05,483
He currently resides in Burbank

1763
01:46:05,484 --> 01:46:07,560
where he shares
a studio apartment

1764
01:46:08,278 --> 01:46:09,862
with his roommate,
Brandon Routh.

1765
01:46:09,863 --> 01:46:13,658
Remember Brandon Routh
from that God-awful Superman movie?

1766
01:46:13,659 --> 01:46:15,201
Jesus Christ!

1767
01:46:15,202 --> 01:46:19,280
Thanks for getting our hopes up
and taking a giant shit on us.

1768
01:46:19,456 --> 01:46:22,750
Rex was forced to give up
his pursuit of Lori.

1769
01:46:22,751 --> 01:46:25,753
Not long afterwards,
he fell into a deep depression

1770
01:46:25,754 --> 01:46:28,289
and died of
Lou Gehrig's disease.

1771
01:46:28,549 --> 01:46:31,133
Donny was arrested
by Boston police

1772
01:46:31,134 --> 01:46:33,970
and charged with
kidnapping a plush toy.

1773
01:46:33,971 --> 01:46:36,597
The charges were dropped
when everyone realized

1774
01:46:36,598 --> 01:46:39,300
how completely stupid
that sounded.

1775
01:46:39,560 --> 01:46:43,062
Robert got a trainer,
lost a substantial amount of weight

1776
01:46:43,063 --> 01:46:44,438
and went on to become

1777
01:46:44,439 --> 01:46:46,682
Taylor Lautner.

